silm:instances_papers_19_mereology_as_colimit_chapters_06_pushout_and_coequalizer_zoo_sections_04_two_cell_pasting_diagrams_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'TwoCellPastingDiagramsConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the head-region olog fragment of Mittens's vet exam: left ear position, right ear position, three-color torbie eye markings; also, the clinical care plan record 77 generated for Mittens at the May 2026 vet visit at the Tartu Animal Clinic; also, the Felis catus taxon node, TSN 183798, kept as a typed leg origin distinct from the apex Mittens-the-cat." .
